  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 6.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gyf hine man téo, þæt he hine utsceóte, geladige hine swa hit on lande stande.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if he is accused of abetting him in his escape, he shall clear himself according to the established custom of the district.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et si compelletur (compellabitur), quod eum emiserit, allegiet se sicut uetus (in terra) lex est.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
